  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + load">Load task, project CLAUDE.md, design §3, the PaneEventBus contract, and the three pane components.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Workspace-originating flows">Activate Workspace→Context (selection → source-attributed playbook/precedent surfacing) and Workspace→Assistant (selection → inline toolbar → `compose_action_request` dispatch through the seam).</step>
    <step order="2" name="Context-originating flows">Activate Context→Workspace (drag precedent as inline citation / click-to-navigate) and Context→Assistant ("use this precedent" → next-action input); Context stays audit-only.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Assistant-originating flows">Activate Assistant→Workspace (draft-alternative ledger entry materializes the pending track-change with provenance) and Assistant→Context (AI-derived insight surfaces with full source attribution).</step>
    <step order="4" name="Verify two-pane rule">Confirm each activated flow lights up at least two panes and every Context entry is source-attributed; leave the ack-on-frame-id upgrade for task 071.</step>
  </steps>

  <outputs>
